+## isqExpand/qa/42
+
+- task_id: `isqExpand/qa/42`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_algorithms`
+- difficulty: `difficult`
+- concept_tags: `Grover算法`, `自适应搜索`, `迭代次数`, `量子优化`, `未知解数量`, `量子 oracle`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
