+2. Inject X error on q[2]
+3. Syndrome extraction using 4 ancilla qubits:
+   anc[i] = q[i] XOR q[i+1] for i=0..3
+4. Correction: if syndrome is 0110, error is on q[2]
+   Use Toffoli gates with appropriate controls
