+$$ |\Psi_m\rangle = Q^m |\Psi\rangle = \cos\left(\frac{2m+1}{2}\theta\right)|\psi_0\rangle + \sin\left(\frac{2m+1}{2}\theta\right)|\psi_1\rangle $$
