+## isqExpand/qa/34
+
+- task_id: `isqExpand/qa/34`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_algorithms`
+- difficulty: `basic`
+- concept_tags: `量子并行性`, `量子叠加`, `阿达马门`, `量子干涉`, `状态空间`
