+
+- task_id: `isqExpand/algo/2`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_algorithms`
+- difficulty: `intermediate`
+- concept_tags: `grover`, `amplitude_amplification`, `quadratic_speedup`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
