+## isqQA/quantum_circuits/53_isq_demonstration
+
+- task_id: `isqQA/quantum_circuits/53_isq_demonstration`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_circuits`
+- difficulty: `basic`
+- concept_tags: `isq_demonstration`, `concept`, `Hadamard门的作用与矩阵`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
