+## isqQA/quantum_circuits/80_popular_explanation
+
+- task_id: `isqQA/quantum_circuits/80_popular_explanation`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_circuits`
+- difficulty: `difficult`
+- concept_tags: `popular_explanation`, `concept`, `isQ的deriving gate自定义门`
