+## isqQA/quantum_crypto/225_academic_definition
+
+- task_id: `isqQA/quantum_crypto/225_academic_definition`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_crypto`
+- difficulty: `difficult`
+- concept_tags: `academic_definition`, `concept`, `量子数字签名`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
