+$$ |\bar{0}\rangle_L = \frac{1}{\sqrt{|\mathcal{S}_X|}} \prod_{f \in F} \frac{I + B_X^{(f)}}{2} |0\rangle^{\otimes n} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{|\mathcal{S}_X|}} \sum_{S_X \in \mathcal{S}_X} S_X |0\rangle^{\otimes n} $$
