+
+### Chain-of-thought reasoning
+
+## Circuit Analysis
+Initial: |+⟩⊗|->.
+CNOT on |+⟩⊗|->: CNOT = (|0⟩⟨0|⊗I + |1⟩⟨1|⊗X).
+Since X|-> = -|->:
+  |0⟩⊗|-> + |1⟩⊗X|-> = |0⟩⊗|-> + |1⟩⊗(-|->) = |0⟩⊗|-> - |1⟩⊗|-> = |->⊗|->.
+H(q[0]): |-> → |1⟩. H(q[1]): |-> → |1⟩.
+Final: |11⟩.
+Expected: [0, 0, 0, 1]
+
