+## isqExpand/fund/48
+
+- task_id: `isqExpand/fund/48`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_foundations`
+- difficulty: `intermediate`
+- concept_tags: `circuit_model`, `mbqc`, `cluster_state`, `computational_equivalence`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
