+## isqExpand/fund/64
+
+- task_id: `isqExpand/fund/64`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_foundations`
+- difficulty: `intermediate`
+- concept_tags: `bit_flip`, `phase_flip`, `depolarizing`, `kraus_operators`, `noise_model`
