+## isqQA/quantum_foundations/16_depth_progression
+
+- task_id: `isqQA/quantum_foundations/16_depth_progression`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_foundations`
+- difficulty: `difficult`
+- concept_tags: `depth_progression`, `concept`, `多体纠缠：GHZ态与W态`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
