+## isqExpand/qa/114
+
+- task_id: `isqExpand/qa/114`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_hardware`
+- difficulty: `intermediate`
+- concept_tags: `quantum_volume`, `benchmarking`, `quantum_hardware`, `NISQ`, `heavy_output_generation`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
