+## isqQA/quantum_ml/37_学术定义维度
+
+- task_id: `isqQA/quantum_ml/37_学术定义维度`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_ml`
+- difficulty: `intermediate`
+- concept_tags: `学术定义维度`, `concept`, `数据编码方法(角度/振幅/基)`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
