+## isqQA/quantum_ml/89_popular_explanation
+
+- task_id: `isqQA/quantum_ml/89_popular_explanation`
+- task_type: `qa_concept`
+- category: `quantum_ml`
+- difficulty: `difficult`
+- concept_tags: `popular_explanation`, `concept`, `量子核方法`
+- source: `qa_pipeline`
