+$$f(\boldsymbol{\Theta}, \mathbf{x}) = \langle \psi(\boldsymbol{\Theta}, \mathbf{x}) | \hat{M} | \psi(\boldsymbol{\Theta}, \mathbf{x}) \rangle$$
